WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.871
Use this final guide when you are unsure Ask what
the outer query needs

00:00:05.897 --> 00:00:13.280
from the inner query One value suggests a scalar
Membership

00:00:13.307 --> 00:00:18.990
suggests IN A related-row question suggests EXISTS
or NOT

00:00:19.016 --> 00:00:26.885
EXISTS A comparison against a set suggests ANY or
ALL Intermediate

00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:32.604
rows suggest a derived table Then ask whether the
inner query depends

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:36.593
on the current outer row If yes it is correlated
